  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now, let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>So, solution of the equation is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>It is given that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>0</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>"
  }
